Z||000000||WampusCat||12-19-2001||07:17 AM||||We're only #7 in Memphis, amazingly enough.  I would have thought we were closer to the top.  They were ranked by annual deaths per 100,000 people.<BR>1-Orlando-18.8<BR>2-Tamp/St.Pete-17.6<BR>3-West Palm Beach-16.6<BR>4-Austin,TX-15.8<BR>5-Las Vegas-15.4<BR>6-Phoenix-15.2<BR>7-Memphis-14.7<BR>8-Jacksonville-14.5<BR>9-Ft. Lauderdale-14.5<BR>10-Kansas City-14.2<P>Ya'll watch out down there in FL!||||reg||11
